sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as HttpApiClient.CallAsync<br/>src/Infrastructure/Client/Core/Client.Http/HttpApiClient.cs
    participant Retry as RetryMiddleware<br/>src/Infrastructure/Client/Middleware/Retry/RetryMiddleware.cs
    participant Attempt as HttpApiClient.AttemptAsync<br/>src/Infrastructure/Client/Core/Client.Http/HttpApiClient.cs
    participant API as Todo API

    Client->>+Retry: RunAsync(call, next, token)
    loop up to TODO_API_RETRY_ATTEMPTS, 3 by default
        Retry->>+Attempt: next(token)
        Attempt->>+API: POST /v1/items/plan, within TODO_API_TIMEOUT
        API-->>-Attempt: answer, or none
        Attempt-->>-Retry: success, or ApiUnavailableException
        Note over Retry: success, a status, or the last attempt: leave the loop
        Note over Retry: ApiUnavailableException: WARN "api client call retried", wait 100ms doubled, plus or minus 50 percent
        Note over Retry: the caller's cancellation ends the wait: the last exception is thrown
    end
    Retry-->>-Client: the outcome of the last attempt
